  "definition": "Adjusted In-stack Concentration Method",
  "effectiveDate": "2022-02-03",
  "historyNote": "#8278, eff 2-4-05 (from Env-A 1406.05); ss by #9601, eff 11-25-09; amd by #9865, eff 2-18-11; ss by #12443, eff 1-5-18; ss by #13334, eff 2-3-22 (formerly Env-A 1405.05)",
